ACT X OF 1995
ACT X OF 1995
SIR SYED UNIVERSITY OF ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY ACT, 1995
CHAPTER‑1
PRELIMINARY
2. Definitions.‑‑In
this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context:‑‑
(i) "Academic
Council" means the Academic Council of the University;
(ii) "affiliated college
or institute' means the College or institute affiliated to the University;
(iii) "Association"
means the Aligarh Muslim University Old Boys' Association of Pakistan, Karachi
registered under the Societies Registration Act, 1860;
(iv) "Authority"
means any of the authorities of the University specified in section 11;
(v) "Board" means the
Board of Governors of the University;
(vi) "Chancellor"
means the Chancellor of the University;
(vii) "College" means
a college and includes an institution in which arrangement exist for imparting
instruction or practical training in course of studies relating to engineering,
technology and such other subjects as may be prescribed;
(viii) "Dean" means
the Head of a Faculty;
(ix) "Director" means
the Head of an Institute;
(x) "Faculty" means a
Faculty of the University;
(xi) "Government"
means the. Government of Sindh;
(xii) "Institute"
means an institute maintained and administered by the University;
(xiii) "Officer"
means any of the officers of the University specified in section 6;
(xiv) "Prescribed"
means prescribed by Statutes, Regulations or Rules;
(xv) "Professor
Emeritus" means a retired professor working in the University in an
honorary capacity;
(xvi) "Statutes, Regulations
and Rules" means respectively the Statutes, Regulations and Rules made
under this Act;
(xvii) "Teaching
Department" means a Teaching Department established and maintained or
recognised by the University;
(xviii) "University"
means the Sir Syed University of Engineering and Technology, Karachi; and
(xix) "Vice‑Chancellor"
means the Vice‑Chancellor of the University.

Officers of the university

ACT X OF 1995
ACT X OF 1995
SIR SYED UNIVERSITY OF ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY ACT, 1995
CHAPTER‑III
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
6. Officers of the University.‑‑The following shall be
the Officers of the University‑‑‑
(i) the Patron;
(ii) the Chancellor;
(iii) the Vice‑Chancellor;
(iv) the Deans;
(v) the Directors;
(vi) the Chairman of Teaching
Departments;
(vii) the Principals;
(viii) the Registrar;
(ix) the Director of Finance;
(x) the Librarian;
(xi) the Controller of
Examinations;
(xii) the Resident Auditor; and
(xiii) such other persons as
may be prescribed to be the officers, of the University.

Authority

ACT X OF 1995
ACT X OF 1995
SIR SYED UNIVERSITY OF ENGINEERING AND TECHNOLOGY ACT, 1995
CHAPTER‑IV
AUTHORITIES OF THE UNIVERSITY
11. Authority.‑‑The following shall be the Authority of the
University:‑‑‑
(i) the Board of Governors;
(ii) the Academic Council;
(iii) the Board of Faculties;
(iv) the Board of Advanced
Studies and Research;
(v) the Board of Studies;
(vi) the Selection Board;
(vii) the Finance and Planning
Committee;
(viii) Affiliation Committee;
and.
(ix) such other Authorities as
may be prescribed.
